        }
      },
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "id": "c7180819-1a2d-4e8f-bcca-53f0652f2a1a",
      "name": "Setup Guide",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -80
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Voice AI Receptionist (Vapi backend)\nIn Vapi, create an assistant with a phone number and set its **Server URL** to this webhook production URL.\n\nAdd two tools to the assistant:\n- **check_availability**(start, end) ISO date-times\n- **book_appointment**(start, end, name, phone, service, notes)\n\nEnable the **end-of-call-report** server message. Create a Google Sheet tab named **Calls**, pick your calendar in both calendar nodes, and fill in Business Settings.",
        "color": 6,
        "width": 680,
        "height": 380
      }
    }
